            },
            "displayName": "Fabrizio Giustina",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Rome"
          },
          "body": "I noticed that also the schema gets default values, for example in oracle:\n\nif (getSchema() == null) {\n   setSchema(\"oracle\");\n}\n\n\nshouldn't that be removed too?\n\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=fgiust",
            "name": "fgiust",
            "key": "fgiust",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=fgiust&avatarId=14337",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=fgiust&avatarId=14337",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=fgiust&avatarId=14337",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=fgiust&avatarId=14337"
            },
            "displayName": "Fabrizio Giustina",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Rome"
          },
          "created": "2008-05-06T07:52:14.098+0000",
          "updated": "2008-05-06T07:52:14.098+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12395038/comment/12594509",
          "id": "12594509",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=thomasm",
            "name": "thomasm",
            "key": "tmueller",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Thomas Mueller",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "body": "> if (getSchema() == null) {\n> setSchema(\"oracle\");\n> }\n> shouldn't that be removed too?\n\nNo. The term 'schema' is a bit misleading: here the schema property controls what .ddl file to use to create the tables. For Oracle, the file src/main/resources/org/apache/jackrabbit/core/persistence/bundle/oracle.ddl file is used. It doesn't have to do with the database schema.\n\nSee also http://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/JCR-1180",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=thomasm",
            "name": "thomasm",
            "key": "tmueller",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Thomas Mueller",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "created": "2008-05-06T08:05:04.178+0000",
          "updated": "2008-05-06T08:05:04.178+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12395038/comment/12594703",
          "id": "12594703",
          "author": {
